# TypeScript - web

Strict mode, ESNext, bundler resolution. Config: `web/tsconfig.json`.

## Path aliases

Import from package barrels only (no `../`, `~/`, or `modules/` in app code):

| Alias | Resolves to |
|-------|-------------|
| `@web` | `web/src` (`web/src/index.ts`) |
| `@admin` | `admin/src` |
| `@shared_modules` | `shared_modules` |
| `@portable` | `portable` |

```ts
import { usePublicPage } from '@web'
import { HOME_PAGE_SEO } from '@shared_modules'
import { setupNui } from '@portable'
```

Legacy aliases (`nucleify`, `modules`, `~/`) may still resolve for tooling; do not use them in new code.

```bash
pnpm typeslint   # tsc --noEmit
```
